:: OC Micah Corner Store Intro [nobr]

As you walk into the corner store, the little bell ringing to announce your presence, you hear a young voice call out. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Welcome! Let me know if you need anything!”</span> It sounds slightly familiar, and you turn to see a young boy standing at the register. It takes you a second to remember where you saw him before. <span style="color:LightGreen">He was the boy who was out on a delivery when his bike chain came off.</span> You remember him mumbling to himself about aliens and what-not when you offered to help him. The boy seems to recognize you as well. <br>

<<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Micah",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, you’re-!”</span> He blushes slightly, realizing that the two of you never made proper introductions. He steps around the counter, patting the dust off his shirt, before holding out his hand. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Thanks, for before. I’m <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Micah</span>. Pleasure to meet you.”</span> You introduce yourself and tell him it was no problem. Though you are curious, why is he behind the counter? He didn’t know this place was hiring kids that young. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, they aren’t. My grandparents own the store, so I help them out whenever I can.”</span> He smiles cutely, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I was on a delivery for them before when you helped me out. Sorry for not telling you my name then, I was having a bit of a day.”</span> He chuckles, rubbing the back of his head. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I know!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Micah</span> walks over to the counter and grabs a piece of candy, putting some money from his pocket next to the register, as he would never steal. He then hands you the candy, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Here you go, for helping me out. My treat!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He smiles as you take the candy, thanking him. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Micah</span> returns to behind the counter and tells you to let him know if you need anything. He’d be happy to help!</span> <br>
<<set $CompletedQuests.push("Micah: Introduction")>>
<<set $ActiveQuests.delete("Micah: Introduction")>>
<<socialChange "Micah" 3 1>>
<br>
